          subject: "Numerical Ability",
          text: "PERCENTAGES: In a local election, 10% of registered voters did not cast their ballots, and 10% of the cast ballots were declared invalid. The winning candidate secured exactly 60% of the VALID votes and won the election by a majority of 1,620 votes over her only opponent. How many registered voters are on the master list?",
