          text: "SPEED & DISTANCE: Runners A and B start jogging from the exact same point on a 1,200-meter circular track. They run in OPPOSITE directions. Runner A's speed is 15 meters per second, and Runner B's speed is 10 meters per second. How many seconds will it take for them to pass each other for the THIRD time?",
