          subject: "Numerical Ability",
          text: "SPEED & DISTANCE: A delivery truck covers a total route divided into three equal distance segments. It travels the first third at 20 km/h, the second third at 30 km/h, and the final third at 60 km/h. What is the exact average speed of the truck for the entire journey?",
          choices: ["30 km/h", "36.6 km/h", "40 km/h", "45 km/h"],
