          subject: "Numerical Ability",
          text: "WORD PROBLEMS: Clerk A can encode a dataset in 10 days, Clerk B in 12 days, and Clerk C in 15 days. Clerk A starts the task alone and works for 2 days. Then Clerk B joins him for exactly 2 days. After that, Clerk A gets reassigned, so Clerk C replaces him and works with Clerk B to finish the job. How many total days did Clerk B and Clerk C work together to finish the remaining dataset?",
          choices: ["2 5/9 days", "2 8/9 days", "3 1/3 days", "3 5/6 days"],
