          text: "PERCENTAGES: A shopkeeper marks his goods 40% above his cost price, and then offers a 25% discount on the marked price to customers. However, he also uses a faulty scale that gives exactly 800 grams of goods when the customer pays for 1 kilogram. What is the merchant's true net profit percentage?",
          choices: ["25.00%", "31.25%", "40.00%", "50.00%"],
