          text: "PERCENTAGES: In a highly contested mayoral election, exactly 10% of the enrolled voters did not cast their votes, and 10% of the votes cast were declared invalid. The winning candidate secured exactly 54% of the VALID votes and won by a majority of exactly 1,620 votes. What is the total number of voters enrolled on the voters list?",
          choices: ["20,000", "25,000", "30,000", "40,000"],
