          text: "SPEED & DISTANCE: A man covers a certain distance on a scooter. If he travels 3 km/h faster, he would take 40 minutes less. If he travels 2 km/h slower, he would take 40 minutes more. What is the exact distance of his journey?",
          choices: ["30 km", "36 km", "40 km", "48 km"],
